          isPartOf: { '@id': 'https://www.abuqitmirlabs.tech/blog/local-seo-citation-building-the-15-directory-checklist#webpage' },
          headline: "Local SEO Citation Building: The 15-Directory Checklist",
          description: "A citation with the wrong phone number doesn't just confuse a customer — it can quietly tell Google your business isn't verified where it claims to be. This g",
          image: "https://www.abuqitmirlabs.tech/images/blog-covers/local-seo-citation-building-the-15-directory-checklist-29a10c29.webp",
