                    "name": "What is the biggest mistake founders make with content marketing?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                              "@type": "Answer",
                              "text": "The biggest mistake is writing for search engines instead of writing for humans. If your content does not provide unique value or a strong point of view, it will fail to rank and fail to convert."
                    }
