                              "text": "A focused, single-use-case RAG integration can go live in as little as six to eight weeks, while broader deployments spanning multiple data sources or departments typically take several months. The timeline depends almost entirely on data readiness. Clean, well-organized source documents can move fast. Scattered, inconsistent documentation across five different systems will add weeks to the data preparation stage before any retrieval work even begins."
